    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39444" root="نجس" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنْجَسُ</span></b>  [<i>More,</i> and <i>most, unclean, dirty, filthy,</i>
or <i>impure</i>]. You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَا تَرَى أَنْجَسَ مِنَ الكَافِرِ</span>
(tropical:)  [<i>Thou wilt not see any one more unclean than the
unbeliever</i>]. (A, TA.)

